Delete Old GitHub Credential on Windows
---------------------------------------
Method 1 — Windows Credential Manager
---------------------------------------
   1. Press Windows key
   2. Search for Credential Manager
   3. Open Credential Manager
   4. Select Windows Credentials
   5. Look under Generic Credentials or Windows Credentials
   6. Find an entry related to:
        git:https://github.com
              or
        github.com
   7. Click the entry.
   8. Click Remove.
   9. Confirm.



