Sign in to GitHub from IntelliJ
------------------------------------
In IntelliJ:
File → Settings → Version Control → GitHub

Add Account → Log In via GitHub
A browser window will open.
  1. Sign in to GitHub.
  2. Authorize IntelliJ IDEA.
  3. Return to IntelliJ.
  4. Your GitHub account should appear under GitHub accounts.

You normally don't need to manually enter your GitHub password into IntelliJ.


